{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-stopping-criteria","title":"成本与停止准则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/practice/cost-stopping-criteria","wordCount":1785,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本与停止准则\">成本与停止准则</h1><p>前面所有篇章都在教「怎么更聪明地标」，这一篇回答一个更朴素也更难的问题：标到什么时候该停？这不是学术细节——停早了，模型本可以更好却交付了；停晚了，每多标一千条只换来零点几个百分点，预算白烧。主动学习的循环天生没有自然终点，它会一直转到你叫停为止，而「何时叫停」恰恰是文献最少、实践最痛的环节。这一篇把停止从「凭感觉」变成可量化的决策：盯住边际收益与边际成本的交叉点，用几种可操作的停止准则把它落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>停止决策的本质是边际分析：每多标一批，带来一点性能提升（边际收益），花掉一点预算（边际成本）。当边际收益降到不再值得边际成本时，就该停。难点在于边际收益事先未知、且要在不浪费验证标注的前提下估计它。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[每轮迭代] --&gt; B[估边际收益&lt;br/&gt;性能还能涨多少]&#10;  A --&gt; C[估边际成本&lt;br/&gt;这批标注花多少]&#10;  B --&gt; D{边际收益 &gt;= 边际成本?}&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[继续标下一批]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[停止: 交付]&#10;  B -.收益难直接观测.-&gt; G[代用信号&lt;br/&gt;不确定性 / 预测稳定性 / 验证集斜率]&#10;  G --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[每轮迭代] --&gt; B[估边际收益&lt;br/&gt;性能还能涨多少]\n  A --&gt; C[估边际成本&lt;br/&gt;这批标注花多少]\n  B --&gt; D{边际收益 &gt;= 边际成本?}\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|是| E[继续标下一批]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[停止: 交付]\n  B -.收益难直接观测.-&gt; G[代用信号&lt;br/&gt;不确定性 / 预测稳定性 / 验证集斜率]\n  G --&gt; D</pre><p>下表归纳几类停止准则，它们都是在「不浪费标注去测性能」与「准确判断该停」之间权衡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>停止准则</th>\n<th>看什么信号</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预算耗尽</td>\n<td>钱/时间用完</td>\n<td>简单可控</td>\n<td>与模型状态无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能平台</td>\n<td>验证集准确率斜率趋平</td>\n<td>直接</td>\n<td>要持续花标注维护验证集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性枯竭</td>\n<td>池中最大不确定性已很低</td>\n<td>不需额外标注</td>\n<td>对模型校准敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测稳定</td>\n<td>连续两轮预测几乎不变</td>\n<td>不需真标签</td>\n<td>可能过早停</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"把标注成本算成一笔账\">把标注成本算成一笔账</h2><p>要做边际权衡，先得把成本和收益放进同一个货币尺度。回忆 <a href=\"../foundations/why-labeling-bottleneck\">标注瓶颈与价值</a> 里单条有效标签成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>label</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{label}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">label</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一轮标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 条的边际成本就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>label</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b \\cdot c_{\\text{label}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">label</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。边际收益要换算成同样单位——把模型每提升一个百分点的业务价值估成金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，则标这一批的净收益是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>Net</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>acc</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>label</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\text{Net} = v \\cdot \\Delta\\text{acc} - b \\cdot c_{\\text{label}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Net</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">label</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>Net</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\text{Net} \\leq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Net</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，即性能提升带来的价值已盖不住标注花费时，理性决策是停。问题是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>acc</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\text{acc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span></span></span></span></span>（下一批能带来的提升）事先不知道——这就是停止准则的全部技术难点：用各种代用信号去<strong>预测</strong>这个未知的边际收益，而不真去花标注测量它。把停止当成一个成本-收益优化问题，而非「标够了就停」的拍脑袋，是这一篇的核心立场。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能平台-最直接但最贵\">性能平台：最直接但最贵</h2><p>最符合直觉的停止信号是看验证集准确率的曲线——它先陡后平（<a href=\"../foundations/why-labeling-bottleneck\">标注瓶颈与价值</a> 里的学习曲线），当斜率连续几轮低于阈值就停。形式上监控滑动窗口内的提升：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>停止当</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>w</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>acc</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>acc</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{停止当} \\quad \\frac{1}{w}\\sum_{t=T-w+1}^{T} \\big(\\text{acc}_t - \\text{acc}_{t-1}\\big) &lt; \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.181em;vertical-align:-1.3527em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">停止当</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3527em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">acc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的硬伤是循环依赖：要测准确率就得有一个带标签的验证集，而维护验证集本身要花标注预算——你为了知道「该不该停止标注」而不得不持续标注。更糟的是主动学习挑出的样本分布有偏（偏向困难样本），用它估的准确率不能直接反映真实分布上的性能，验证集必须独立同分布地另采，成本更高。所以纯性能平台法在标注极贵时反而不划算，要和不需额外标注的信号配合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不需真标签的停止信号\">不需真标签的停止信号</h2><p>为绕开「测性能要花标注」的死循环，实践更爱用不需要真标签的内在信号。</p>\n<p><strong>不确定性枯竭</strong>：监控未标池里<strong>最大</strong>的不确定性。如果连池中模型最拿不准的样本，其不确定性都已低于某阈值，说明没有更值得标的样本了，可以停。它复用 <a href=\"../strategies/uncertainty-sampling\">不确定性采样</a> 的打分、零额外成本，但对模型置信度校准敏感——校准差的网络会虚低不确定性、过早叫停。</p>\n<p><strong>预测稳定性</strong>：比较连续两轮模型对同一批留出样本的预测，如果几乎不变（用 kappa 或预测 F 值的预期变化度量），说明再标也撼不动模型了。基于「预测 F 值预期变化」的停止准则是文本分类里被研究较多的一种。它不需真标签，但风险是模型可能暂时进入平台又在更多数据后突破，导致过早停。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>是否需真标签</th>\n<th>主要敏感点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>验证集斜率</td>\n<td>需要（贵）</td>\n<td>验证集分布偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性枯竭</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>模型校准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测稳定性</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>可能早停</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践智慧是组合多个信号、且都设软阈值——任一信号触发先告警人工复核，而非自动硬停。LLM 时代还多了一维成本：用 LLM 当 oracle 时，停止准则要把 LLM 的变动调用成本也算进边际成本，这把账本和 <a href=\"llm-assisted-labeling\">LLM 辅助标注</a> 连了起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预算分配-不只是何时停\">预算分配：不只是何时停</h2><p>停止是「总量」决策，但预算还有「分配」维度——同样十万美元，是一次性标完，还是分轮迭代、每轮标多少？分轮的好处是每轮都能用更新的模型挑更准的样本，但分太细则重训和循环开销大（<a href=\"../strategies/batch-mode-active\">批量主动学习</a> 里的批量大小取舍）。一个稳健的默认是「几何递减批量」：早期模型差，多标一些打基础；后期模型好，每批挑得更精、批量可减小。</p>\n<p>还要给预算留出三块常被忘记的开销：黄金标准集的构建（质量治理的地基，见 <a href=\"../labeling-systems/quality-agreement\">质量与标注一致性</a>）、验证集的维护、以及标注指南迭代的人力。新手常把全部预算砸进「标更多训练样本」，结果没钱建黄金集、质量失控。这种「把资源在勘探与利用间分配」的权衡，和 <a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/sample-size-power\">A/B 测试</a> 里用功效分析决定样本量是同一类决策——都在问「投多少资源才够，多了浪费」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>停止决策的本质是边际分析：边际收益降到盖不住边际成本时就停，而非「标够了」拍脑袋。</li>\n<li>把成本与收益换算到同一货币尺度，净收益转负即理性停止点；难点是边际收益事先未知。</li>\n<li>性能平台法最直接但要持续花标注维护独立验证集，标注极贵时不划算。</li>\n<li>优先用不需真标签的内在信号：不确定性枯竭（对校准敏感）、预测稳定性（可能早停）。</li>\n<li>预算还有分配维度：几何递减批量稳健，且务必给黄金集、验证集、指南迭代留预算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../strategies/batch-mode-active\">批量主动学习</a>——批量大小与预算分配的耦合；<a href=\"../foundations/why-labeling-bottleneck\">标注瓶颈与价值</a>——边际递减学习曲线的来源。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/sample-size-power\">样本量与功效</a>——「投多少资源才够」的同类决策框架。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成本与停止准则","id":"成本与停止准则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"把标注成本算成一笔账","id":"把标注成本算成一笔账"},{"level":2,"text":"性能平台：最直接但最贵","id":"性能平台-最直接但最贵"},{"level":2,"text":"不需真标签的停止信号","id":"不需真标签的停止信号"},{"level":2,"text":"预算分配：不只是何时停","id":"预算分配-不只是何时停"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"LLM 辅助标注","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/active-learning-data-labeling/practice/llm-assisted-labeling"},"next":null}